WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.414
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.825
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho... seifuku...
mada kami, kawakana... i

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.578
Amakute nigai. .. marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao wo mitai!

00:02:14.106 --> 00:02:22.036
GINTA'S CONFESSION —
"I'M NOT GONNA
LET HIM TAKE YOU!"

00:12:32.056 --> 00:12:34.616
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:40.798 --> 00:12:43.392
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.302 --> 00:22:13.031
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.924 --> 00:22:36.722
LEGEND OF LOVERS —
"WITH ALL MY HEART
IN THE MEDALLION."

00:22:54.178 --> 00:23:00.344
Seiza—tachiga kirameite. ..
hizuke o kaeru

00:23:01.919 --> 00:23:08.222
Yosoyuki—gao ga ko cha ni...
sotto tokeru no

00:23:08.592 --> 00:23:16.727
Tada no watashi ni...
modoru shunkan

00:23:17.434 --> 00:23:22.599
Mada mada ima
wa nemuresou ni nai...

00:23:24.008 --> 00:23:27.068
Totsuzen—sugiru. ..

00:23:27.845 --> 00:23:31.713
Atarashii tokimeki ni

00:23:36.921 --> 00:23:39.355
Okashi—na kimochi yo

00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:47.124
Tatta hitori no...
dareka ni kawatteyuku...

00:23:47.698 --> 00:23:54.729
Sonna yokan. ..
dakishimeteitai. ..

00:23:55.306 --> 00:23:58.867
Nemuru made...
